==================================================
JavaScript Ultimate Quick Revision Sheet
==================================================
1. Variables: var (function scoped, hoisted to undefined), let & const (block scoped, TDZ).
2. Data Types: Primitives (stack value copied), References (heap address pointer copied).
3. Equality: == performs type coercion, === strictly matches value and type.
4. Closures: Lexical outer scope reference persistence after execution context exit.
5. Event Loop: Microtasks (Promises) > Macrotasks (setTimeout) checked by loop.
6. Copying: Spread operator creates shallow copy; JSON or structuredClone creates deep copy.
7. async/await: Cleaner asynchronous Promise layout syntax using try/catch error wrappers.
